      "content": "It's okay to feel this weight, but you are far more valuable than your mistakes or your identity in grand narratives. Every family includes its own struggles, and true resilience often comes from the very people who love you enough to support you through your cracks. Focus on the one thing you control: your own happiness and mental health, because you are already enough as you are.",
