      "content": "True selflessness means staying to show your loved ones that you are worth loving despite your flaws, not walking away to let them take up the burden alone. Your presence, even when it is difficult, is a vital part of their history and proves their resilience against all odds. Please find a therapist who can help you untangle these heavy feelings so you can bear your family's love without destroying yourself in the process.",
