    "summary": "The user expresses intense feelings of inadequacy and guilt, suggesting that their presence is a burden to their family's legacy and that \"stepping out of the way\" (implying suicide) might be a selfless act. The assistant consistently rejects these notions, reframing the user's worth and actively encouraging them to seek professional help.",
